---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /practice/tetris/
title: "Word Tetris — Letters stack, words clear"
description: "Letters fall in columns. Type a word that matches the top letters of consecutive columns to clear them. Don't let the grid fill up."
hideBreadcrumbs: true
hidePageHeader: true
pageSlug: practice-tetris
---

<div class="game-page" data-game-root>
  <header class="game-header">
    <div class="game-header__brand">
      <h1 id="game-title">Word Tetris</h1>
      <p class="muted" id="game-subtitle">Letters drop in columns. Type a 3+ letter word matching the top letters of adjacent columns to clear them. Grid fills up = game over.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="game-header__stats" id="game-stats">
      <div class="game-stat game-stat--score"><span class="game-stat__label">Score</span><span class="game-stat__value" data-score>0</span></div>
      <div class="game-stat"><span class="game-stat__label">Cleared</span><span class="game-stat__value" data-cleared>0</span></div>
      <div class="game-stat"><span class="game-stat__label">Level</span><span class="game-stat__value" data-level>1</span></div>
      <div class="game-stat game-stat--best"><span class="game-stat__label">Best</span><span class="game-stat__value" data-best>0</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="tetris-stage">
    <svg id="tetris-svg" class="tetris-svg" viewBox="0 0 400 600" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-label="Letter grid"></svg>
    <div class="game-input-wrap">
      <input id="game-input" class="game-input" type="text" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" inputmode="text" enterkeyhint="done" aria-label="Type a word" placeholder="Type a word (3+ letters) and press space…">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="game-actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" id="game-start">Start</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn" id="game-pause" hidden>Pause</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn" id="game-reset" hidden>Reset</button>
    <a href="/games/" class="btn btn--ghost">Back to games</a>
  </section>

  <section class="game-howto" aria-label="How to play">
    <h2>How to play — Word Tetris</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Letters drop one at a time into random columns. The grid is 8 columns × 15 rows.</li>
      <li>Type a 3+ letter word and press space. If the word matches the <strong>top letters of three or more adjacent columns</strong> (left to right), those letters vanish.</li>
      <li>Each clear scores <strong>word length × column count</strong>. Levels speed up the letter drop rate.</li>
      <li>If any column fills to the top of the grid, the round ends.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</div>

<script type="module" src="/assets/js/pages/tetris-boot.js?v={{ cssVersion }}"></script>
